        ],
        "summary": "List options",
        "description": "Public, paginated catalog ordered by immutable catalog ID (not creation time or score). Follow nextCursor until absent to retrieve all items. A page may be empty while still having a cursor. Pagination is not a snapshot during concurrent submissions.",
